    <data key="d4">Two sites are equivalent iff they share the same Wyckoff label and have equal projection (hkl . frac_coords) onto the transport axis within tolerance (JumpAxisEquivalenceAnalyzer.find_equiv_classes_for_axis).</data>
    <data key="d5">oriented_unit_cell_for_axis(structure, hkl_structure): exact-integer extended-GCD plane basis + metric-aware 2-D Gauss/Lagrange reduction + brute-force minimal transverse vector, validated against area(u,v)*height(w) == primitive_cell_volume and |det([w,u,v])| == 1 (not pymatgen.core.surface.SlabGenerator, which was found to produce a non-minimal, non-primitive oriented cell for some {hkl} in body-centered tetragonal structures).</data>
